    "tree_id": "d00101a6e59c6a48189738dd24ba9338a5adc502",
    "message": "Phase 1b step 3: re-enable MGCB content via dotnet-tools manifest\n\nAdds Tests/Cocos2DMono.IntegrationTests/.config/dotnet-tools.json pinning\ndotnet-mgcb 3.8.4.1 (matching MonoGameVersion) and the four platform\nmgcb-editor variants — same set used by the historical legacy test\nprojects.\n\nThe csproj's previously-commented MonoGameContentReference is restored\nand now points at ..\\cocos2d-mono.Tests\\Content\\Content.mgcb (the\nexisting legacy MGCB source). A RestoreDotnetTools target runs\n`dotnet tool restore` before MSBuild's Restore phase so the mgcb tool is\navailable when MGCB tries to compile content.\n\nThis makes the consolidated harness functionally complete: assets are\nprocessed into .xnb at build time and the runtime ContentManager can\nresolve them.\n\nLocal verification on Windows host: net9.0 build clean, MGCB processed\nContent.mgcb successfully, 0 errors / 122 pre-existing warnings.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
    "timestamp": "2026-06-04T20:31:27Z",
